 not furnished quarters \nor rations in kind, and (2) allowances \nfor quarters to enlisted men of the first, \nsecond, and third grades in the active, \nmilitary, naval, or Coast Guard service \nof the United States having dependents \nas defined in section 4 of the said act, \nfor periods during which public quarters \nare not provided and available for such \n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_9206.txt","sha256":"d9ad6a677b3ccdeeb2d09781f1725087a30d0b5479a5b2fb75fe5ab8fcf0ad31","source":{"line":234,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"2ae44069a9fc0fd07f6c4c063bf9b38f308ce522dcebe101441f24b6321c0ca2"}}]}
